OL,3,CFirefighters tackle blaze at 150-year-
OL,4,Cold church
OL,6,FPictures from Facebook - Andyman Clarke
OL,8,FFirefighters have been tackling a
OL,9,Fblaze at a church in Leicester that is
OL,10,Fmore than 150-years-old.
OL,12,FSt Andrews on Jarrom Street is near De
OL,13,FMontfort University close to the city
OL,14,Fcentre.
OL,16,FCrews have been at the scene overnight
OL,17,Fdealing with the fire.
OL,19,FPeople have been asked to keep windows
OL,20,Fand doors shut.
